   {
    "ja": "全部の日記"
   },
   {
    "en": "Diary Of All"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "I must not forget to write in my diary. It would be very difficult for us tomorrow.\n\nAfter an accident, Ichika's memory only lasts for one day. What supports her is the diary that she's been verifying and updating on her own. The diary, which she must never lose, falls out of her hands due to a certain incident…",
   "ja": "日記を書き忘れてはいけない。明日の私たちが、とても困るからー 事故で記憶が1日しか保たなくなった一花。彼女を支えるのは、自ら検証し更新し続けた日記。決して失くしてはならないその日記は、あるきっかけから彼女の手を離れてしまい…"
  },
